From: apranikstar <trialoftheniku@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 20:39:45 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 03/12] ALFA cards: Track branch after ARCPID; Xe 2 bar and
 C4F10 variants calibrated on k4geo full sim

- delphes_card_ALFA.tcl: write the Track branch from TrackMerger/tracks; ARCPID clones
  the candidates, so TrackSmearing/tracks carried no ARC information.
- delphes_card_ALFA_Xe2bar.tcl (main) and delphes_card_ALFA_C4F10.tcl, generated by
  examples/ALFA/make_cards.py: N_sat, thickness, sigma_E, sigma_single, BendingCoefficient
  (0.19, fitted to the full-sim sigma1(p)), eta-binned ring efficiency with the aerogel
  crack, Poisson yield fluctuation.
- Makefile regenerated by ./configure (ARCPID registered).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KP5vqAGH2XiGXWtPhaonke
